in_scope_clauses.summary:
Control of product + process nonconformities — handling of
potentially unsafe products; withdrawal / recall procedures;
effectiveness evaluation of recall execution.

Internal audit — planned audit program covering FSMS
conformity + effectiveness; auditor competence + objectivity;
corrective actions on findings.

Nonconformity + corrective action — react to nonconformity;
evaluate need for action to eliminate causes; implement +
review effectiveness; update FSMS as necessary.

Current Good Manufacturing Practice — personnel hygiene + GMP
training (§117.10); plants + grounds (§117.20); sanitary
operations (§117.35); sanitary facilities + controls (§117.37);
equipment + utensils (§117.40); processes + controls (§117.80);
warehousing + distribution (§117.93); defect action levels
(§117.110).
